Title: Production SIGNL4 identity + account portal share token-signing RSA key, OAuth client_id, and scope set with a publicly reachable staging environment
Severity: Medium-High (validated: Medium per bountify gate style — no final token mint without staging creds)
Affected:
  - https://connect.signl4.com/identity/                 (production OIDC provider)
  - https://account.signl4.com/manage                    (production account portal)
  - https://devconnect.signl4.com/identity/              (staging OIDC provider, publicly reachable, no WAF headers, 108.143.123.104)
  - https://devaccount.signl4.com/manage                 (staging account portal)
Steps to reproduce (read-only):
  1. GET https://devconnect.signl4.com/identity/.well-known/openid-configuration → 200, issuer devconnect.signl4.com/identity, x-client-ver ID_NET10_0 8.19.2.0 (staging build)
  2. GET https://connect.signl4.com/identity/.well-known/openid-configuration → 200, x-client-ver ID_NET8_0 7.7.3.0 (prod build) — different software train
