STEP 1 — DELTA
- [NEW] api.signl4.com serves a full interactive IdentityServer at `/identity`: OIDC discovery 200, Welcome/Login/SignUp UI (`pageModel_signupDisabled=false`), issuer `https://connect.signl4.com/identity` while ALL endpoints point to api.signl4.com — JWKS at `/identity/.well-known/openid-configuration/jwks` returns byte-identical kid `91EE4F3CE94EB517AF66B254F7497ECB0E31EE27RS256` (same n/x5t/x5c CN=*.signl4.com) as connect+devconnect.
