- [NEW] api.signl4.com/.well-known/apple-app-site-association (200) = appID F2UW9VUYTE.com.derdack.projectx, deep links /manage/Signls (+ NOT /manage/Signls/NewSignl), /manage/account/signup; /.well-known/assetlinks.json (200) = com.derdack.signl4 with 3 APK cert fingerprints.
- [NEW] prod IdP OIDC (now confirmed from all 3 prod hostnames + devconnect): grants incl `password`, `device_code`, `CIBA`, `token-exchange`; `request_parameter_supported=true`, `require_pushed_authorization_requests=false`, request-object/CIBA/DPoP algs incl PS/ES; `id_token_signing_alg_values_supported=['RS256']`.
